    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The Butterfly Effect</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra makes a friend during one of the best friends squads many missions across Ethiera, which leads to an unforgettable night. A night that leaves her with feelings of confusion, guilt, and uneasiness. Eventually, the feelings seem to consume her, and she confides in an unlikely friend.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
